WEBVTT

00:09:58.617 --> 00:10:01.109
or if they do, they don't really
connect with people

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:02.649
because of the language issues.

00:10:02.673 --> 00:10:05.814
This could be an incredibly
powerful device

00:10:05.838 --> 00:10:07.926
for building bridges between cultures.

00:10:08.317 --> 00:10:12.501
And I daresay lots of unexpected downsides

00:10:12.525 --> 00:10:14.571
that we haven't even
fully thought through.

00:10:14.595 --> 00:10:18.791
And like in education right now,
if you knew that this was coming,

00:10:18.815 --> 00:10:23.577
does that mean that it's crazy
to send your 13-year-old

00:10:23.601 --> 00:10:27.544
into Spanish or English or Chinese
lessons at this point?

00:10:27.854 --> 00:10:30.604
KFL: That's a really good question.